    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Program Zero is a speedrunning game focused around fast-paced movement and comboing abilities developed by one person. Move through dozens of levels, aiming for the quickest time possible. Sprint, slide, and jump above a seemingly infinite abyss in order to escape the cruel simulation you're stuck in. Abilities exist throughout the worlds to increase your speed, and combining them unlocks countless strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb the leaderboard</strong>\u00a0by replaying levels in order to get faster and faster times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the simulation</strong>\u00a0by completing levels and getting closer to the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock upgrades</strong>\u00a0to get faster times.</p>",
